  dialogueLines:
  - characterName: Man
    text: Hello there
  - characterName: John
    text: 
  - characterName: Man
    text: 'Okay '
  - characterName: Daniel
    text: My name is Daniel, I don't know what happened suddenly everyone started
      eating each other
  - characterName: John
    text: Did you see a girl with her mother, having black hair and her mother is
      blonde.
  - characterName: Daniel
    text: No, I did not see a girl and her mother, but I saw a girl running.
  - characterName: John
    text: Where?
  - characterName: Daniel
    text: She was heading to the city park.
  - characterName: Daniel
    text: Don't you know when help will come?
  - characterName: John
    text: Soon
